WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.637
Algorithmic Organization.

00:00:02.587 --> 00:00:07.300
All entities are clustered and grouped based on frequency of interaction.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:15.537
Connections are weighted by co-occurrence in official records including financial ties, lobbying contacts, and vote correlations.
